WEBVTT

00:15:26.365 --> 00:15:30.444
has students from K to 12 
and to undergrad.

00:15:30.444 --> 00:15:34.873
Hamad Bin Khalifa University 
came as a research-intensive university,

00:15:34.873 --> 00:15:40.048
focusing on postgraduate studies
to provide that ability to students

00:15:40.048 --> 00:15:46.639
to follow their ability of conducting 
master and PhD degrees

00:15:46.639 --> 00:15:50.993
and believing that your postgraduate 
is very essential

00:15:50.993 --> 00:15:52.717
in order for you to achieve

00:15:52.717 --> 00:15:55.904
the aspiration of the country 
of a knowledge-based economy.

00:15:55.904 --> 00:15:58.221
When HBKU was created,

00:15:58.221 --> 00:16:01.439
it was created 
on very important principles